WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.110
Hey, do you have a favorite reality show?

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:06.170
Oh come on, don't lie, everyone has one.

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:10.759
Dr. Clef loves some American Ninja Warrior,
and I’ve got it on good authority that Dr.

00:00:10.759 --> 00:00:14.190
Bright can’t get enough of The Bachelor,
so how about you, huh?

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:18.720
Do you obsessively follow the romantic highs
and lows of Love Island, or are you more the

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.449
type who likes to curl up with a mug of hot
cocoa and enjoy a nice, wholesome episode

00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:25.609
of The Great British Baking Show?

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:30.160
Do you ever yell at the TV when the contestants
on Jeopardy just can't get the answer right?

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:34.600
Do you get a kick out of seeing what crazy
collectibles will show up on this week's episode

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.149
