00:00:36.149 --> 00:00:40.940
If you answered yes to any of these, you're
not alone - Millions of people around the

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.560
world still tune in to all kinds of reality
TV.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:49.420
Personally, I just can't get enough of my
favorite hidden camera show: Laugh is Fun.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.420
What's that?

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:53.050
You've never heard of Laugh is Fun?

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.180
Oh, boy.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.730
You're really missing out.

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:02.699
If you like reality TV, you're gonna love
Laugh is Fun.

00:01:02.699 --> 00:01:07.830
Laugh is Fun, also known as SCP-2030, isn't
a show that you can watch on TV.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:13.140
Instead, it appears as the most popular form
of media distribution in the current year.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:18.060
Today, you can find it on file-sharing and
streaming websites, but in the 2000's, you

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:22.670
could rent it from the DVD kiosk at the mall,
and back in the ‘90s, it used to show up

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:26.110
as multi-tape sets in video rental stores.

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.530
Even though the SCP foundation has only been
aware of Laugh is Fun since 1993, it has a

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:37.979
recorded 38 seasons as of 2014, meaning that
it may have existed in some form as far back

00:01:37.979 --> 00:01:40.060
as the 1970s.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:44.790
If you want to binge all 38 seasons, you might
also want to look it up under the names Laugh

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:49.079
is Life, or, in some countries, Laugh is Laugh.

